PTX cub-lookback+no-fence
"Variant of cub-lookback without the fence after the relaxed status load. CUB keeps __threadfence in the poll loop (single_pass_scan_operators.cuh:968). Expected: allowed."
{
v=0;
t=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0 ;
 st.weak.global v, 1      | ld.relaxed.gpu r0, t     ;
 st.release.gpu t, 1      | ld.weak.global r1, v     ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
